# issue-read: gone unavailable
# request: start activate stop clear-error recover
# actor: none template policy-only partial partial-running partial-crashed suspended running crashed transitional
# rule issue-gone: 50 cases
# rule issue-unavailable: 50 cases
# issue-read  request  actor  outcome
gone          *        *      issue-gone discard -
unavailable   *        *      issue-unavailable keep -
